coder › Done on `work/main` (commit `df6d701`). Two files changed:

- **`src/toc.ts`** — implemented and exported `toc(markdown: string): Heading[]` with the spec's fence logic, ATX regex, slug generation (lowercase, `[^\p{L}\p{N}]+` → one dash, trim dashes) and deduplication (Map counter + Set of used slugs).
- **`src/toc.test.ts`** (new) — 16 tests covering: single h1/h2, leading spaces limit, tab after `#`, 7 hashes, `#` without space, empty text, fence skipping (with language tag, closing fence, unclosed fence), slug rules (accented chars, punctuation, trim dashes), duplicate slug numbering (including collision with a natural `-2` text), empty/non-alphanumeric headings, trailing `##` kept in text, and CRLF line endings.

